<title>UK: QUALITY-AA July UK cargo service report.</title>
<headline>QUALITY-AA July UK cargo service report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Airlines said its July UK air cargo service standard report for all five UK stations,shows that at Heathrow export freight deliveries available-on-door within 20 minutes slipped to 75.9 percent in July from 80.3 percent in June.</p>
<p>The five stations are London Heathrow, London Gatwick, Manchester, Birmingham and Glasgow.</p>
<p>The waiting time for Heathrow at 14 minutes in July was little changed from June's 13. The percentage flown-as-booked from Heathrow rose to 93.0 percent from 92.7 percent in June.</p>
